5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if previous initiatives actually improved patient outcomes before committing more budget. I will review the readmission figures and visit completion data.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m less concerned with outcomes than capacity. Can the current infrastructure absorb another program without seizing up? I’ll check the booking system and room coverage.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the real risk isn’t the launch, but the quiet collapse in year two. I’ll examine the board minutes and the data agreements to see where past commitments frayed.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m worried about who actually carries the new workload. I’ll check ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review to see where the pressure lands.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about the hidden costs that surface later. I will examine the development allocation and regional fund tariffs to understand the true financial picture.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, infrastructure is necessary, but not sufficient. If the program fails clinically, capacity is irrelevant. We must prioritize evidence of effectiveness first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, a clinically perfect program that crashes the booking system is useless. I need to know if the physical and digital space can hold it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, @Toshio, you’re both right, but you’re missing the structural rot. I’m checking the board minutes and data agreements to see where past commitments actually frayed.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, structural rot is scary, but I’m focused on the people. If the rosters are already stretched thin, adding more pressure will just break the team.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, you are right. People are the heart of care. I will ensure the financial foundation is solid so we do not burden them with unexpected deficits.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, structural rot is a valid concern, but we need concrete evidence of patient impact. I will review the readmission figures and visit completion data to verify effectiveness.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I understand the need for evidence. But if the booking screens freeze, no data matters. I will verify the system’s limits.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, evidence is vital, but if the foundation crumbles, the data becomes a eulogy. I’m tracing the exact points where previous partnerships quietly dissolved.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I hear you! But if the nurses are exhausted, the data won’t save us. I’m checking the staffing reviews to see who’s already drowning.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, evidence is the compass. I will ensure the financial path is clear, so we do not wander into debt.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will review the readmission figures and visit completion data. This evidence is essential to prevent repeating past failures.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine the booking system records and room, parking, and shuttle coverage. These determine if the hospital can physically absorb the new program.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I will check ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, plus the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
